  <main class="page">
    <header class="hero">
      <div class="topline"><span>WEDDING INVITATION</span><span class="seal">M &amp; Y</span><span>2026 · 11 · 14</span></div>
      <div class="hero-copy"><div class="eyebrow">一 封 来 自 山 谷 的 请 柬</div><h1>山 谷 来 信<em>we are getting married</em></h1><p>在初冬微凉的山风里，<br>我们想把这一刻的欢喜，郑重地分享给你。</p><div class="date-line">SATURDAY · NOVEMBER 14</div></div>
      <div class="flower one">✽</div><div class="flower two">✽</div>
      <div class="mountains"><svg viewBox="0 0 1200 320" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-label="莫干山手绘山谷"><path d="M0 247 C92 229 146 136 230 177 C288 205 295 122 366 153 C431 182 456 97 531 144 C595 184 608 84 689 139 C743 175 784 131 846 165 C936 215 958 134 1047 174 C1100 198 1147 168 1200 149 V320 H0Z" fill="#bdcbb6" opacity=".78"/><path d="M0 272 C97 220 150 242 224 205 C293 170 348 212 407 190 C494 158 543 219 621 179 C706 135 760 203 827 185 C908 163 952 230 1032 186 C1094 152 1156 187 1200 170 V320 H0Z" fill="#8fa48d"/><path d="M0 282 C73 253 130 273 201 238 C281 197 337 253 423 219 C499 189 560 251 650 219 C750 184 801 245 894 217 C1000 185 1064 244 1200 213 V320 H0Z" fill="#6d866c"/><path d="M103 267c30-28 43-40 67-65M135 251l-3-47m18 31l31-20M871 235c21-30 42-40 68-72m-38 49l-15-44m21 28l31-19" stroke="#526950" stroke-width="3" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".75"/><g fill="#d9a7a1"><circle cx="168" cy="194" r="4"/><circle cx="185" cy="208" r="3"/><circle cx="906" cy="163" r="4"/></g></svg></div><div class="lace"></div>
    </header>
    <section><div class="section-label">the day unfolds</div><h2 class="section-title">这一日的约定</h2><p class="note">请把这一天留给山谷、晚风与相聚。<br>我们在枫鹃谷，等你来见证。</p><div class="timeline"><div class="event"><div class="time">15:30</div><div class="dot"></div><div><h3>宾客签到 · 领取伴手礼</h3><p>在草木与暖意里，慢慢开启这一日。</p></div></div><div class="event"><div class="time">16:08</div><div class="dot"></div><div><h3>婚礼仪式</h3><p>山谷为证，挚爱为名。</p></div></div><div class="event"><div class="time">16:50</div><div class="dot"></div><div><h3>拍照合影</h3><p>请把笑意留在我们共同的相片里。</p></div></div><div class="event"><div class="time">18:08</div><div class="dot"></div><div><h3>晚宴</h3><p>烛光、佳肴与不散场的祝福。</p></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="place"><div class="place-grid"><div class="sketch"><svg viewBox="0 0 500 330" role="img" aria-label="莫干山枫鹃谷民宿手绘"><rect width="500" height="330" fill="#dfe8da"/><path d="M0 205 Q85 113 160 179 Q236 77 315 173 Q385 110 500 170V330H0Z" fill="#a9bd9f"/><path d="M47 287V171l82-56 108 52v120z" fill="#f5eee1" stroke="#596a55" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M34 177l94-79 122 68-10 13-111-57-80 70z" fill="#aa7664" stroke="#596a55" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M142 183h56v104h-56z" fill="#899e83" stroke="#596a55" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M68 197h49v42H68zM215 195h46v43h-46z" fill="#b8d0c4" stroke="#596a55" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M274 292V201l70-46 99 47v90z" fill="#f7f0e4" stroke="#596a55" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M264 204l79-64 113 56-12 13-101-46-67 55z" fill="#bd8a78" stroke="#596a55" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M355 217h55v75h-55z" fill="#899e83" stroke="#596a55" stroke-width="3"/><path d="M20 298c40-15 58-13 99-5 52 9 93-16 153-2 87 19 143-17 220 1" fill="none" stroke="#657a5d" stroke-width="4"/><g stroke="#657a5d" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M16 279q1-41 18-63m-7 36l-22-11m26-6l19-15M470 282q-6-51-25-70m12 42l28-14m-30-7l-22-18"/></g><g fill="#d99d9a"><circle cx="36" cy="216" r="6"/><circle cx="21" cy="234" r="5"/><circle cx="444" cy="216" r="6"/></g><text x="250" y="318" text-anchor="middle" fill="#5a6b58" font-size="14" font-family="serif" letter-spacing="3">枫 鹃 谷 · 莫 干 山</text></svg></div><div class="place-copy"><div class="section-label" style="text-align:left">where we gather</div><h3>莫干山枫鹃谷民宿</h3><p>藏在山谷深处的一方温柔居所。<br>沿着石阶与树影而来，赴一场初冬的欢聚。</p><div class="address">浙江省湖州市德清县莫干山镇<br>枫鹃谷民宿</div><div class="weather"><b>☁</b><span><strong>初冬山居穿衣提示</strong><br>11月中旬山间昼夜温差较大，建议备一件浅色披肩或外套，和晚风温柔相处。</span></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="attire"><div class="section-label">dress in soft colors</div><h2 class="section-title">晚宴穿搭小建议</h2><p class="attire-intro">请和山谷一起，穿一点淡淡的颜色。<br>米白、豆沙粉、鼠尾草绿，都是今晚很美的选择。</p><div class="looks"><article class="look"><div class="figure"><svg width="150" viewBox="0 0 160 230"><circle cx="80" cy="35" r="20" fill="#d8a787"/><path d="M57 31q23-31 47 0" fill="none" stroke="#6d5747" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M60 62q20 9 40 0l14 108H46z" fill="#e8c6c2"/><path d="M46 170h68l13 38H33z" fill="#e8c6c2"/><path d="M52 101l-26 36m82-36l27 36" stroke="#d8a787" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M62 209v12m35-12v12" stroke="#705a50" stroke-width="7"/></svg></div><h3>豆沙粉 · 连衣裙</h3><p>轻盈的缎面或薄纱，配珍珠耳饰。</p><div class="palette"><i style="background:#e8c6c2"></i><i style="background:#f4e9df"></i><i style="background:#c6a18d"></i></div></article><article class="look"><div class="figure"><svg width="150" viewBox="0 0 160 230"><circle cx="80" cy="35" r="20" fill="#d6a585"/><path d="M56 32q23-34 48 0" fill="#51443e"/><path d="M52 67h56l9 93H43z" fill="#e7dfc9"/><path d="M43 160h74l-12 55H55z" fill="#e7dfc9"/><path d="M62 214v10m34-10v10" stroke="#65584d" stroke-width="7"/><path d="M52 88L25 131m83-43l27 43" stroke="#d6a585" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg></div><h3>奶油白 · 西装</h3><p>柔和廓形，搭一枝小小的胸花。</p><div class="palette"><i style="background:#e7dfc9"></i><i style="background:#aab89e"></i><i style="background:#b49680"></i></div></article><article class="look"><div class="figure"><svg width="150" viewBox="0 0 160 230"><circle cx="80" cy="35" r="20" fill="#d9a988"/><path d="M57 33q22-27 46 0" fill="#5e493f"/><path d="M57 64h46l23 118H34z" fill="#aec0aa"/><path d="M51 95l-26 44m84-44l28 44" stroke="#d9a988" stroke-width="10" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M59 212v10m38-10v10" stroke="#62584d" stroke-width="7"/><path d="M62 63l18 25 18-25" fill="none" stroke="#f6f1e4" stroke-width="3"/></svg></div><h3>鼠尾草绿 · 轻礼服</h3><p>低饱和色调，与山林相映成趣。</p><div class="palette"><i style="background:#aec0aa"></i><i style="background:#dba7a1"></i><i style="background:#f1e8d8"></i></div></article></div></section>
    <section class="stay"><div class="section-label">a little note</div><h2 class="section-title">关于住宿与接送</h2><div class="stay-card"><p>11月14日当晚，我们将为大家统一安排住宿。</p><p>如 <strong>不需要14日晚住宿</strong>，请提前告诉我们；<br>若想在 <strong>11月13日晚提前入住</strong>，也请尽早告知，方便我们为你预留山谷里的房间。</p><p>我们会统一安排 <strong>德清站</strong> 接送，<br>期待在抵达的那一刻，就给你一个拥抱。</p></div></section>
    <section class="rsvp"><div class="section-label">rsvp</div><h2 class="section-title">请告诉我们你的安排</h2><form class="form-wrap" id="rsvpForm"><div class="form-row"><div class="question">1. 你会来参加我们的婚礼吗？</div><div class="options"><label class="option"><input type="radio" name="attendance" value="出席" required><span>欣然出席</span></label><label class="option"><input type="radio" name="attendance" value="遗憾缺席"><span>遗憾缺席</span></label></div></div><div class="form-row"><div class="question">2. 需要安排哪几晚住宿？</div><div class="options"><label class="option"><input type="checkbox" name="stay" value="11月13日"><span>11月13日</span></label><label class="option"><input type="checkbox" name="stay" value="11月14日"><span>11月14日</span></label><label class="option"><input type="checkbox" name="stay" value="无需住宿"><span>无需住宿</span></label></div></div><div class="form-row"><label class="question" for="arrival">3. 预计什么时间到达德清站？</label><input class="arrival" id="arrival" name="arrival" placeholder="例如：11月14日 14:20 左右"></div><button class="submit" type="submit">寄 出 回 信</button><div class="thanks" id="thanks">收到你的回信啦，山谷里见！</div></form></section>
    <footer class="footer">M &amp; Y <small>WITH LOVE · MOGANSHAN · 2026.11.14</small></footer>
  </main><script>document.getElementById('rsvpForm').addEventListener('submit',e=>{e.preventDefault();document.getElementById('thanks').style.display='block';e.currentTarget.querySelector('.submit').textContent='已寄出 · 谢谢你';});</script>
</body></html>
